      "resolution": "The contemporary idiom sous d’autres cieux means elsewhere/in other countries or places, corroborated by Le Robert’s current locution and recent examples. The fixed ciel definition supplies the country/climate semantics, while cieux supplies the exact plural spelling and /sjø/. The accepted text makes the idiom explicit instead of teaching an unrestricted synonym for lands."
    }
